COSMOS GEN-CONVOY §6 — surface the core probe + dequeue-loop timer into VoxelEngine.get_stats(), byte-off.

Folds the weak-linked core probe (godot engine patch 0003) and a main-thread dequeue-apply loop timer into
the stats Dictionary that remote_bridge.gd reads every frame, under key "alloc_probe" (main_ms/workers_ms/
main_n/workers_n/dequeue_ms/compiled). The probe accessor is __attribute__((weak)), so this links and runs
whether or not the core patch is present; when the probe was not compiled in, compiled=false and the alloc
numbers are omitted (inert / byte-off). Applies on top of godot_voxel patch 0015.
